' LifeLine Styles


title Research Pipeline (Flat — Single LLM Agent)

participant "Campaign\nOrchestrator" as Orch
participant "research_agent\n(LLM)" as Agent
participant "google_search\n(tool)" as GS
participant "recall_prior_insights\n(Memory Bank tool)" as Recall

Orch -> Agent: _run_agent_and_capture("combined_final_cited_report")
activate Agent

Agent -> Recall: 1. Recall prior campaign insights
Recall --> Agent: Historical learnings

Agent -> GS: 2. Primary research (5-7 searches)
GS --> Agent: Search results

Agent -> GS: 3. Follow-up research (3-5 gap-filling searches)
GS --> Agent: Additional results

Agent -> Agent: 4. Compose cited report\n(all phases in single LLM call)

Agent --> Orch: Research report text
deactivate Agent

Orch -> Orch: Persist via state_delta\n["combined_final_cited_report"]

